{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2021-11-09 13:00:00', 'title': 'BANK OF AMERICA NAMES AL MCRAE PRESIDENT OF ATLANTA', 'text': "ATLANTA, NOV. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BANK OF AMERICA HAS NAMED AL MCRAE AS PRESIDENT OF BANK OF AMERICA ATLANTA. MCRAE SUCCEEDS WENDY STEWART, WHO WAS RECENTLY NAMED A MEMBER OF THE COMPANY'S SENIOR MANAGEMENT TEAM AND THE PRESIDENT OF GLOBAL COMMERCIAL BANKING."}